# BookChain - Community Library Resource System

A blockchain platform for managing library resources, tracking reading engagement, and rewarding active community participation.

## Features
- Reading activity tracking
- Library coordinator management
- Engagement assessment system
- Participation premium distribution

## Smart Contract Functions
- Record reading sessions
- Assess community engagement
- Distribute participation premiums
- Track library statistics

## Usage
Encourages community reading through blockchain-verified activity tracking and engagement rewards.